OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals warn of 'extremely busy'
OL,4,AA&E amid pressures
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitals across the South East have
OL,7,Fwarned that A&E services are "extremely
OL,8,Fbusy" and urged patients to consider
OL,9,Falternative services for non-urgent
OL,10,Fcare.
OL,12,FEast Surrey Hospital in Redhill has
OL,13,Fasked patients to "only come to us for
OL,14,Flife threatening emergencies" while
OL,15,FRoyal Surrey County Hospital in
OL,16,FGuildford has warned people that they
OL,17,Fare "currently experiencing long
OL,18,Fwaiting times".
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
