OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals warn of 'extremely busy'
OL,4,AA&E amid pressures
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaidstone and Tunbridge Wells NHS Trust
OL,7,Falso said in a statement on social
OL,8,Fmedia that less urgent conditions "may
OL,9,Fwait longer than usual" amid the
OL,10,Fpressures.
OL,12,FIt comes as senior health leaders
OL,13,Fwarned in October of "ominous signs"
OL,14,Fpointing to the beginning of winter
OL,15,Fpressures.
